  "manual_note": "The page heading \"Treatment safety\" is the app's \"Safety\" section. \"Instance name\" is the preference the app titles \"Name\" (pref_title_patient_name). The protection levels show in the app as \"Level 0: Application protection\", \"Level 1: Bolus protection\" and \"Level 2: Settings protection\". \"Settings protection\" is also a standalone key (settings_protection), but it is unused."
